{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"t":"My grandparents used to love looking through cruise brochures, even when they weren't","x":0.19544454150931359,"h":0.019563998602085686,"c":1,"y":0.097332355711734486,"w":0.61604197184244791},{"c":1,"x":0.19550173754370803,"y":0.11476557006161092,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.61764704386393232,"t":"planning on going on a cruise. Until very recently TV ads for cruises always felt dated and"},{"c":1,"x":0.19723184194523166,"h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.63321797688802084,"t":"aimed at retirees. Cruise lines have been slow to adopt the power of social media but that's","y":0.13081395361017301},{"y":0.14495717658225571,"t":"all changing. Leading cruise lines now employ top agencies to produce first rate videos for","w":0.62812255859374999,"c":1,"x":0.19718280375546621,"h":0.017467521469938463},{"t":"social media channels.","c":1,"y":0.16282468253929583,"x":0.19540239454129713,"w":0.15769662221272787,"h":0.013097524142415495},{"x":0.19550173348888222,"w":0.26643597920735679,"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"It will be interesting to see whether ...","y":0.1875000001187116,"c":1},{"t":"TEST 3","y":0.22077020334606989,"h":0.016308430110432148,"w":0.084859937032063737,"x":0.47227591290805759,"c":1},{"t":"PART 1","y":0.28479105477089095,"c":1,"x":0.19547884936131604,"w":0.083090744018554707,"h":0.014720216007646503},{"h":0.0089677699885225559,"t":"TAMMY:","x":0.19546946588766731,"w":0.046777331034342423,"c":1,"y":0.31673704522108637},{"x":0.19550172997785514,"h":0.0087209305119230196,"y":0.3488372091396934,"w":0.034602076212565114,"c":1,"t":"PAUL:"},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"t":"TAMMY:","y":0.37936046490767439,"w":0.04844290733337403,"c":1,"x":0.19377162583158286},{"y":0.39534883729523851,"x":0.19377162733481118,"t":"PAUL:","c":1,"w":0.036332178115844743,"h":0.010174418263205087},{"x":0.19550173049823599,"h":0.011627907349230693,"t":"TAMMY:","y":0.41133720903302584,"w":0.046712802251180019,"c":1},{"t":"PAUL:","y":0.42732558118003583,"x":0.19377162553341629,"w":0.036332181294759125,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1},{"w":0.04844290733337403,"h":0.011627907349230804,"y":0.47529069746581387,"t":"TAMMY:","c":1,"x":0.19377162583158286},{"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","y":0.50726744169783289,"w":0.034602076212565114,"x":0.19550172997785514,"h":0.0087209305119230196},{"y":0.52180232559654594,"w":0.050173009236653632,"x":0.19377162708582546,"c":1,"h":0.01308139510051276,"t":"TAMMY:"},{"y":0.53924418583119849,"x":0.19550172997330223,"w":0.034602076212565086,"t":"PAUL:","h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1},{"t":"TAMMY:","y":0.57122093038371491,"w":0.046712802251180019,"c":1,"x":0.19550173027912124,"h":0.010174418263205198},{"c":1,"h":0.010174418263205087,"x":0.1937716264805654,"t":"PAUL:","y":0.58720930247086833,"w":0.038062283198038754},{"x":0.19377162785356603,"y":0.63372092990096607,"w":0.048442904154459648,"t":"TAMMY:","c":1,"h":0.011627907349230804},{"w":0.034602076212565058,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"t":"PAUL:","y":0.67151162757538452,"x":0.19550173023281781},{"h":0.011627907349230804,"w":0.046712802251180019,"c":1,"t":"TAMMY:","y":0.75145348816431656,"x":0.19550173027579409},{"w":0.034602076212565086,"t":"PAUL:","y":0.76744186024980321,"x":0.19550172997330223,"h":0.011627907349230693,"c":1},{"x":0.19533933479249493,"h":0.01262035596779465,"c":1,"y":0.79892238013595529,"w":0.048767697016398104,"t":"TAMMY:"},{"t":"PAUL:","y":0.81540697658155381,"h":0.0087209305119231306,"c":1,"w":0.032871971130371103,"x":0.19723183441751341},{"c":1,"w":0.048442907333374002,"t":"TAMMY:","x":0.19550172989732678,"y":0.82994186048026686,"h":0.01308139510051276},{"h":0.0087209305119231306,"c":1,"x":0.19723183441751341,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"PAUL:","y":0.84738372076760016},{"y":0.87790697675933649,"w":0.04844290733337403,"t":"TAMMY:","h":0.013081395100512871,"x":0.19550172992616191,"c":1},{"h":0.010174418263205087,"y":0.89534883735458937,"c":1,"w":0.038062283198038754,"x":0.1937716264805654,"t":"PAUL:"},{"t":"You know when you went to the Shetland Islands last year, Paul? Did you go by","y":0.31245626319333564,"x":0.27854672037344791,"w":0.5484428914388022,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565315},{"c":1,"y":0.32848837201074088,"x":0.27681660906491468,"w":0.14013840993245441,"t":"ferry or did you fly?","h":0.016158234080373979},{"t":"We went by ferry, Tammy. I prefer driving to flying - the journey feels like part of","x":0.27854670375571439,"y":0.3444767442607195,"w":0.55882354736328121,"h":0.015988371937820656,"c":1},{"x":0.2782646466464318,"h":0.014813489226547571,"y":0.36112281497840981,"w":0.085333824157714844,"c":1,"t":"the holiday."},{"h":0.0161287369137465,"y":0.37645348844334969,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. Which ferry company did you use?","x":0.2785467072878719,"w":0.29065745035807289},{"h":0.018905261915993066,"w":0.55724909464518224,"x":0.27845430280390115,"c":1,"t":"There's only one - it's called Northern Ferries. The ferries all leave from Aberdeen.","y":0.39003396301928017},{"y":0.40832750177056032,"h":0.01469559132260323,"w":0.16608996073404947,"t":"How frequent are they?","x":0.27854671507308526,"c":1},{"w":0.52595153808593753,"h":0.01609923974711891,"c":1,"t":"The service is pretty limited - there's only one ferry leaving every evening in","x":0.27854672222882071,"y":0.42441860472574744},{"x":0.27849114217200771,"w":0.52778142293294272,"h":0.016566485437669476,"y":0.43918355861925162,"t":"summer anyway, seven days a week - I'm not sure about the winter months.","c":1},{"y":0.45529666343749242,"x":0.27844103727984665,"w":0.30813685099283855,"t":"They may only run on four or five days then.","h":0.017795122278746023,"c":1},{"t":"OK. So it's an overnight trip. I quite like that idea. Leaving at night and waking up","y":0.47235829249404437,"x":0.2785467228347136,"w":0.54152247111002605,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.48837209309756746,"w":0.55709340413411457,"t":"as you arrive on the island. Can you remember how much you paid for your tickets?","x":0.27854672347938503,"h":0.015988371937820434},{"w":0.55709340413411457,"h":0.016150096815895409,"c":1,"t":"They were really cheap and four people and a car worked out at just under £250.","y":0.5041987403132917,"x":0.27854672345142983},{"x":0.27848021728978134,"y":0.51905369101699372,"c":1,"h":0.017976236977387039,"w":0.49493001302083339,"t":"Really? I was expecting it to be more like £400 during the peak season."},{"x":0.2784984548875345,"w":0.52950454711914063,"h":0.016722615737861601,"t":"So was I. It's great value. It's a good idea to book in advance because I think","c":1,"y":0.53479261550182622},{"w":0.5070901489257813,"t":"they get booked up quite quickly - especially during the school holidays.","c":1,"x":0.27845660839708292,"y":0.5497173074388253,"h":0.019876623587478104},{"h":0.018718055447471071,"c":1,"t":"Yes, I suppose so. I'm just not 100% sure of our plans yet. What if I had to cancel?","w":0.55723953247070312,"x":0.27847498762732265,"y":0.56571696043716457},{"w":0.52952651977539067,"t":"That could be a problem. I don't think it's their policy to give refunds - just a","c":1,"y":0.58254319340207106,"x":0.27849175292698325,"h":0.017626314583652158},{"x":0.27849125974760058,"y":0.59875389324978667,"h":0.01710316315658289,"w":0.54336130777994784,"c":1,"t":"voucher - which you can use at a later date. But you have to cancel a month in"},{"t":"advance to get that.","y":0.61616515018079898,"c":1,"h":0.013296011196641033,"x":0.28027681506242064,"w":0.14186851501464842},{"t":"Right. Well we need to make up our minds quickly then.","y":0.63081395355194869,"h":0.016141959551416729,"c":1,"w":0.39100346883138026,"x":0.27854670861533037},{"x":0.27854670197782394,"y":0.66860465123468193,"w":0.51211074829101566,"h":0.016139925402140154,"t":"You'd want to book a cabin too. We booked too late to get a cabin with a","c":1},{"w":0.51903111775716149,"c":1,"x":0.27854672478776688,"t":"window. They're more expensive but much nicer than the inner cabins. You","y":0.68459302333001359,"h":0.015988371937820434},{"t":"don't have to book a cabin at all but I think it's worth paying for. They also have","y":0.70048985336177105,"x":0.27854670074470866,"w":0.55017303466796874,"c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"c":1,"y":0.71656976751587687,"t":"luxury cabins, which are only for two people and have a TV - but I wouldn't","x":0.27681659872946357,"w":0.52768168131510418,"h":0.016110428235512564},{"c":1,"t":"bother with those.","x":0.27854671506535256,"y":0.73401162801986186,"w":0.13148788452148436,"h":0.013081395100512871},{"c":1,"x":0.27852904725799355,"y":0.74992555974407682,"w":0.086540520985921188,"h":0.014683764159387436,"t":"No, I agree."},{"t":"The only other thing I can think of is to make sure you bring snacks for the kids.","h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.55190312703450517,"x":0.27854670629048256,"c":1,"y":0.76452064408364406},{"c":1,"t":"The selection on board is quite limited and not that healthy either.","w":0.46020762125651038,"x":0.27854670831262041,"h":0.015988371937820434,"y":0.78052325588839511},{"w":0.35986160278320317,"t":"Mmm. What about wifi on board? Is that any good?","x":0.27854670717412527,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"y":0.79636109194826543},{"h":0.016095171448565426,"y":0.81245626319454434,"c":1,"x":0.27854671605393028,"t":"Not really. So it's best to bring some books for them.","w":0.37024220784505207},{"w":0.51048044840494788,"t":"OK. We may need to bring the dog if I can't get anyone to look after him.","c":1,"y":0.82675843267767346,"x":0.28022073436940625,"h":0.018347878319304511},{"x":0.27854671142913268,"y":0.84289713062210248,"w":0.53806228637695308,"c":1,"h":0.016114497201437761,"t":"We brought ours and it was fine. The kennels on board are OK - they're quite"},{"x":0.27854671680303073,"w":0.28200691223144531,"y":0.86039188230584784,"t":"big - you just need to provide a blanket.","c":1,"h":0.016095171448565426},{"y":0.87645348813020463,"c":1,"x":0.27854671570493844,"w":0.14705881754557293,"t":"Uhuh. Sounds good.","h":0.014534884186538477},{"h":0.016143993700693526,"c":1,"x":0.27854671364366512,"t":"It was all very easy really - and it was quite an adventure for the kids. They","y":0.890832750394428,"w":0.51557093302408852},{"w":0.51038060506184901,"x":0.27681661785392064,"h":0.016095171448565426,"c":1,"y":0.9069279213393896,"t":"loved being on the sea at night and in the morning keeping a lookout for"},{"x":0.27838950167003401,"c":1,"h":0.016499202346534791,"y":0.92276768997198555,"t":"dolphins - we saw loads.","w":0.17501714070638019},{"x":0.86328013566874295,"w":0.053716545104980362,"c":1,"y":0.050763040873553877,"h":0.014752987300373666,"t":"Test 3"},{"t":"040","h":0.013081395100512871,"x":0.85467128015140115,"y":0.14680232566708284,"w":0.034602076212565058,"c":1},{"y":0.39389534891105837,"w":0.024221453666687043,"x":0.85467128000722081,"t":"Q1","h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1},{"y":0.44040697681384244,"x":0.85467128016452121,"w":0.025951557159423766,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"t":"Q2"},{"w":0.025951557159423766,"x":0.85467128016452121,"c":1,"h":0.01308139510051276,"t":"Q3","y":0.50436046518593547},{"w":0.025951557159423766,"c":1,"x":0.85467128015731231,"t":"Q4","h":0.01308139510051276,"y":0.60029069774826771},{"y":0.6845930233205153,"t":"Q5","w":0.025951557159423766,"h":0.01308139510051276,"x":0.8546712801730405,"c":1},{"t":"Q6","x":0.8564013838134491,"y":0.81249999976903398,"h":0.011627907349230804,"c":1,"w":0.024221453666687043},{"y":0.85901162797663322,"w":0.024221453666686932,"t":"Q7","x":0.85640138382121245,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"w":0.024221453666687043,"y":0.92296511635291889,"x":0.8564013838134491,"t":"Q8"},{"h":0.013081395100512871,"c":1,"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"107","x":0.8823529416839494,"y":0.95058139543452458}]}